Congratulations. This definitely seems like a worthy service to
perform in the game. I am surprised that you chose to try to do it in
a game that was to be your first time ascending.

As for determining which high altar is which - it is deliberately not
easy. You can't rely on the presence of a _priest(ess)_ of any
particular alignment - those are scattered all over the Astral Plane.
You can either stand on the altar itself and see what it is, or you
can tell from the alignment of the _high priest(ess)_. Now, I believe
that the only ways that you are suppose to be able to tell their
alignment is by chatting with them or attacking them (looking at them
with the normal or magical means does not show alignment). There is
currently a cheaty way of doing it by seeing the message that you get
when you attempt to Call them something when viewing them from afar,
such as with telepathy. (Anyone with more familiarity with the code
want to correct this?

